{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 2973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Part of this video was\nsponsored by Google Domains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3840,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a US government warehouse"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5790,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sells almost\nanything you can imagine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8280,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Blueberries, steel, cigarettes,\nlimestone, a standard bullet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12990,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even some things you\ndon't want to imagine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15630,
    "dDurationMs": 3493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also see you have domestic sludge there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19123,
    "dDurationMs": 947,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Dr.Place laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20070,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is domestic sludge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22500,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, when you flush your toilet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24960,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it goes through the sewer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27420,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it goes into a\nwastewater treatment plant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29580,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first step is to get rid\nof all the solid material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32670,
    "dDurationMs": 2853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We took that, dried it down,\nso it's a nice fine powder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36360,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wouldn't recommend smelling it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38700,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What is the purpose of all this stuff?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41010,
    "dDurationMs": 3093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why are they selling it\nand why is it so expensive?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45660,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does it ever feel like you're\nliving inside a sci-fi story"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50490,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or something?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51323,
    "dDurationMs": 1507,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Dr. Choquette] You know,\nI've been here for a long time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52830,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I don't think it from that perspective,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55050,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I should say yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56610,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] The science\nfiction element to me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58440,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is like there's someone\nthinking about that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60900,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61733,
    "dDurationMs": 997,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's someone collecting that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62730,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems so fictional."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64710,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like why should a place like this exist?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67710,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are apple leaves and\npeach leaves, oyster tissue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71250,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bars of zinc metal, carbon\ndioxide in nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74850,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In these vats of liquid nitrogen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76680,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are samples of marine animals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79140,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Mussel samples, dolphin\nsamples, whale samples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82200,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Birds as well, bird tissue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85248,
    "dDurationMs": 3345,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And some human tissue as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89520,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] But perhaps the\nweirdest thing they sell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91440,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is something really mundane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94440,
    "dDurationMs": 903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Peanut butter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97050,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It looks like a peanut butter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98100,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is peanut butter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98940,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's creamy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99780,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] It's probably\nthe most expensive jar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101760,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of peanut butter in the whole world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103980,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Well, we essentially\npay for a company to make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105930,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "generic peanut butter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107190,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We might have 2000 jars\nof generic peanut butter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110220,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what we do is we then go through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112140,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and measure the fats in these jars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113790,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and figure out how much of\nvarious compounds are in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117150,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we actually then slap on a label"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118980,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and provide a certificate at the end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121200,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Have you ever eaten some\nof this peanut butter?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124080,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- All of these things are\nnot for human consumption"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125820,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I don't know if\nI could actually tell you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127260,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how old it is, but it's old enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129570,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you probably don't want to eat it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131640,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How much does it cost?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132810,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- These are not sold at\ncommercial grade prices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134940,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, this jar of peanut\nbutter is not $3.99 cents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139050,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This jar, I believe, is\naround a thousand dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142080,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is not something that\nwould be viable for you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143640,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make your peanut butter\nand jelly sandwich with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146550,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] An ordinary jar of peanut butter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148290,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "costs less than $5."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150270,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on the label you\ncan see the ingredients"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152430,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the amounts of different nutrients"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153990,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like protein, fats, sugar, and sodium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157200,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those values have been\nmeasured by the manufacturer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159630,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using different machines\nand analytical techniques."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162900,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how do you know those\nresults are accurate?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165990,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, this is where the government's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167610,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "standard jar of peanut butter comes in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170280,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is mixed up so carefully and thoroughly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172980,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that each jar contains\nexactly the same substance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176190,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We take great pains at\nhomogenizing these things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178740,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Make sure it's consistent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180420,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Then scientists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181320,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the National Institute of\nStandards and Technology, NIST,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184680,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "take years to painstakingly\nidentify the quantities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188160,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of all the different\ncompounds in the peanut butter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190950,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with specified uncertainties."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193560,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This peanut butter is then known"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195420,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a standard reference material or SRM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199320,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They sell these perfectly characterized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201930,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "SRM samples of peanut\nbutter to researchers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204840,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and manufacturers so they can\ncalibrate their equipment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208350,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Essentially, the buyer\nknows that their equipment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210420,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is working properly if,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212280,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when they run the standard peanut butter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214230,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they get the values NIST\nsupplies on the certificate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217650,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We've spent a lot of time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218730,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make sure that we're\nconfident and, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220920,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can spend years studying\nthe amount of fat in here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224100,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and trying to figure out\nexactly what those numbers are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226710,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So what you're paying for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228300,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not really the peanut butter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230400,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's the knowledge of exactly\nwhat is in the peanut butter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234600,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And so this is what\nreally drives the cost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237930,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a standard reference material"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240000,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is our ability to assert the truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242790,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We produce what I call truth in a bottle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245700,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You might think, why does it matter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247290,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the label on my\npeanut butter is accurate?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249360,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it is way more than\nthe things on the label"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251550,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that NIST measures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254040,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Peanut butter actually\ncontains naturally occurring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256980,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "aflatoxins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258180,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're are carcinogen\nwhich can cause liver cancer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260850,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're produced by\nfungi on the peanuts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264060,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if your peanut butter is made from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265890,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a bad batch of peanuts,\nyou want the factory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268500,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be able to accurately detect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270360,
    "dDurationMs": 2358,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "elevated levels of aflatoxins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272718,
    "dDurationMs": 912,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're able to do that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273630,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the standard\npeanut butter contains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276090,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a known level of\naflatoxin that can be used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278610,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to calibrate their equipment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280470,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Will the FDA like sample peanut butters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284790,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and look for aflatoxin?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286110,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- A lot of times you actually\nhave commercial laboratories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288510,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that measure it in accordance to the FDA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290490,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The FDA may encourage them\nto use a reference material,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293250,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "standard reference material,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294420,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make sure they're\ngetting the right numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296040,
    "dDurationMs": 1923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "FDA may not be handling it themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299430,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] There are different challenges"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300930,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to measuring the components\nof different foods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303330,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fine powder, for example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304650,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is easier to characterize\nthan goopy peanut butter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307980,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's helpful to have\na standard material"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310500,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that closely matches the target"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312750,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in composition and consistency,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315330,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's also impossible\nfor NIST to characterize"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318180,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every different type of food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319860,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We're not gonna make a trout and a perch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322290,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and salmon material,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323910,
    "dDurationMs": 1745,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all these different,\nwith the same numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325655,
    "dDurationMs": 3385,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're kind of grab an average\nfish and kind of treat that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329040,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you're measuring it in other fish,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330420,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can usually use it as a surrogate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332070,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So you have a standard trout?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333690,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Dr. Place] Correct, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335550,
    "dDurationMs": 2298,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Tell me about Meat Homogenate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337848,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Dr. Place laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338681,
    "dDurationMs": 3739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It is a mixed meat product\nthat has been mixed thoroughly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342420,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "been ground into a very fine particle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344280,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and packed into a very nice tin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346260,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Why do you mix like chicken and pork?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349740,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why not just have like\na chicken reference,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351390,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a pork reference?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352470,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We never do this by ourselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354000,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We always work with these\nindustry companies and say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355867,
    "dDurationMs": 2003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Hey what kind of mixes do you need?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357870,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we request that kind\nof material to be blended"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361170,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] For a reference\nmaterial to be useful,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363480,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't have to be the exact material"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365490,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a manufacturer wants to characterize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367470,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just has to be close enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369630,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "NIST sells around 30 different food items"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372150,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are spread around\ntheir food triangle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375030,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the corners of the triangle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376350,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are a 100% carbohydrate, a\n100% fat, and a 100% protein."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380820,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, based on their mix of\nthese three macro ingredients,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384120,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all foods fall somewhere on this triangle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386760,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to characterize each\none, you would want to use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the closest standard reference material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391590,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If you're trying to do\nyour measurements and tell,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394380,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, a regulatory authority\nthat I'm making, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397200,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a food that's a kibble,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398700,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'm measuring it\nagainst peanut butter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400380,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're gonna be saying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401213,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Well, that peanut butter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402046,
    "dDurationMs": 1694,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has a wildly different fat content.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403740,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what we wanna give them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404850,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is something, a matrix, that\nlooks as much as possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407940,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as what they're used to dealing with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409800,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] They even have\na standard diet mix."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413100,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is called typical diet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415230,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Through surveys, they identified\nwhat the average American"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417390,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eats and they purchased it\nall and they blended it all up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422340,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they freeze dried\nit into a nice fine powder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425520,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a light gray\npowder and this represents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428490,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the nutritional components"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429720,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that an average American would consume."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431520,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it represents the sugar content,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433710,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it represents the proteins\nthat you might have,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435870,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any vitamins you might have,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437190,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any fats you might have\nis all in a little jar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439680,
    "dDurationMs": 1383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we puree up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442260,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] In total, NIST has nearly 1300"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445080,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "standard reference materials."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449190,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is our warehouse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450720,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so it's an approximately\n20,000 square foot warehouse"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454320,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in which we store all of\nour inventory, our products,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457440,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the SRMs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458273,
    "dDurationMs": 1447,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we are a business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459720,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, what excites me about this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461850,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "being on the technical\nside, is that I get to run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464070,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a 20 million business within\nthe federal government."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466410,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We sell about 30,000 units a year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468960,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So each order is about three units."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471450,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Half of them are sold domestically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472950,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and half are sold to an\ninternational audience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475260,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You can see all the\nprices on on our website."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477270,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's shop.nist.gov is\nthe e-commerce storefront"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481620,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for all these materials."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482850,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can search for whatever you want."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484020,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can search for peanut butter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485070,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can search for meat homogenate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486720,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] If I like\nhad a thousand dollars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488490,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would you sell that to me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489870,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There is some control to who we sell to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493110,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I feel like this is\nunfair like I'm a scientist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495870,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I got a thousand bucks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497910,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "NIST won't sell to just anyone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500070,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there are plenty of websites that do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502290,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this part of the video is\nsponsored by Google Domains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505110,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The easiest way to set\nup an online business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507390,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a shop where I\nsell a product I invented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509580,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called Snatoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510690,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a molecular modeling kit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512160,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the atoms snap\ntogether magnetically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514740,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, when I came up with\nthe name Snatoms back in 2015,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517650,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first step was to\ncheck if the domain name"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520260,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "snatoms.com was available."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521820,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have a good idea, you\nshould claim that domain name"
    } ]
  }, {
