  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563640,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Google Workspace or Google Analytics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565800,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to help me understand\nand build the business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568050,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So claim your own domain\nname with Google Domains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570750,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting at just $12 a year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573090,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Go to domains.google/veritasium\nto get 20% off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577470,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your first year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578490,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will put that link\ndown in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580980,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So thanks to Google Domains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582450,
    "dDurationMs": 2013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for sponsoring this part of the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586860,
    "dDurationMs": 2343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's not just food\nyou need standards for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590220,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In the early 19 hundreds, like 1905,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593820,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was a huge issue\nwith the quality of steel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597090,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was being used in rail cars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599220,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both locomotives and on the tracks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601680,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was that they knew\nwhat they had to have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603540,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the alloys to make it work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605340,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just that all the\nfoundries that were making 'em"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607200,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had no way to compare their\nresults of the material"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609930,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they were making to\nwhat every other chemist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611970,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knew they should be making."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613560,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so Congress basically said"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615480,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to National Bureau of\nStandards at the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617130,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we need you to come up with\nstandard samples of steel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619920,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that everyone can be on the same page."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622890,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so what we did was we\nmade these standard steels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626250,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "analyzed them for all\ntheir constituent parts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628290,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so all the elements, the chrome, the iron,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630390,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the hydrogen carbon and\nthen distributed that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634320,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the stakeholders, again the foundries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636270,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that they can inter compare\nand compare their results"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639030,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a known source of steel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641700,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those were our very first\nproducts that we produced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644880,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Steel is still\none of the most important"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647010,
    "dDurationMs": 1593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "SRMs at NIST."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650940,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's your best selling product?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653370,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Ah, those are called Charpies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655950,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Charpies?\n- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656880,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, let's go look at a Charpie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658470,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you wanna test how strong your steel is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661770,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what Professor Charpy,\nMr.Charpy, came up with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664890,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was a test where he set up a pendulum"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668880,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and at the end of a pendulum is a weight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670560,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you pull that pendulum\nup to a certain distance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673110,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can calculate it's potential energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675810,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the bottom of the\nswing of this pendulum,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678900,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the arc, is a vice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681180,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in the vice, is held\na standard piece of metal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686610,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called a Charpy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688110,
    "dDurationMs": 1437,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this has a little V-notch in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689547,
    "dDurationMs": 3483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so the idea is that\nthe pendulum comes through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693030,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and breaks this thing and then\nit goes up on the other side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695760,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And from that you can then\ncalculate the amount of energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698040,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it took to break this piece of steel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700230,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every company in the\nUnited States and, frankly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702510,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "internationally, now has\nto check their materials"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706140,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "against our Charpies annually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708000,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the kind of steels they're making"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710190,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are used in pipelines or they're\nused in defense industries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712800,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, for tanks, for things\nthat store nuclear waste."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716100,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I have a joke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717060,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I love things that break or\nburn and these things break"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719640,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they have to break\nand they can't reuse 'em."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721440,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we sell a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723120,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How many would you sell in a year?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724950,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We sell of those, of\nall the different kinds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726930,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we sell about 8,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729360,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Woah.\n- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730680,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] NIST has been making these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732120,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "standard reference materials\nfor over a century."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735540,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is what our very\nfirst standard sample"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737790,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "number one looks like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738840,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the real deal and it's\ngray powder, it's limestone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743190,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are still making limestone\nnumber one for 110 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748590,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is still so popular"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749970,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we sell 40 to 50\nunits a year of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752880,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Huh.\n- Isn't that wild?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754170,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very few companies are in\nexistence that are still selling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756480,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some of their original products and we do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760260,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Most of the SRMs\nwe've discussed so far"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762630,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are used for calibration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764250,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's another class\nof SRMs used for validation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767730,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This means they're used\ndirectly in industry tests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770490,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to ensure consistency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772140,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An example is cigarettes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774660,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Evidently, smoking in\nbed was a real issue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776730,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, people were\nlike catching on fire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779520,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so there was a lot of regulation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782010,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as to how materials in your\nmattress or in your sheets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785790,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or your bed clothes should\nreact to a combustible source."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789480,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we produced some standard cigarettes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792840,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that, essentially, along\nwith the ASTM tests,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796950,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would help a manufacturer\ndetermine how flammable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800160,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their furniture was or their\nbed clothes or their mattress."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804240,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] And for those\ntests to be consistent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806490,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the fires must be started"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808170,
    "dDurationMs": 3046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a standardized NIST cigarette."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811216,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(siren blaring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812049,
    "dDurationMs": 1611,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fires started by smoking materials"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813660,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the leading cause of\ndeath by fire in the home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816150,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the US."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817470,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Products like this, but\nalso with the regulations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819840,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that were in place and just\nthe educational campaigns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822930,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that went on have saved many, many lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826140,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] But they also\nhave standards for things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827730,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would never expect,\nlike a standard bullet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831240,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When a bullet is fired\nthrough a gun, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834090,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rifling in the barrel\nimparts marks to the bullet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838020,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Forensic labs\nthen have to measure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839940,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these grooves to match the\nbullet from the crime scene"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842070,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to others fired by the suspected weapon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844530,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how do you know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845520,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are accurately measuring the grooves?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848040,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So this has standard marks on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851730,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They replicated a bullet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853350,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Putting, I believe, essentially,\nnano-indentations on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856170,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So very, very fine marks and\nmapped it on this bullet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859200,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They weren't fired through a\ngun, they were manufactured."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861900,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So, to validate their equipment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863310,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forensic labs can run the standard bullet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865260,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the same time as a\nbullet from a crime scene,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867870,
    "dDurationMs": 2313,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they know their\nmeasurements are accurate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872760,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The goal of every standard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874410,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to quantify something about the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876600,
    "dDurationMs": 3393,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something important that's\nusually pretty hard to measure,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879993,
    "dDurationMs": 2907,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(vacuuming noise)\nlike house dust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882900,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In the early nineties, we\nworked with maid services"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886890,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we got vacuum bags."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888870,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We went to hotels, went to motels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890760,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "took all the vacuum bags that\nwe got from all these hotels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893160,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and houses and everything,\nmixed it together in a big pot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's fully mixed, so every little jar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898590,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has the same number of chemicals,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900090,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has the same amount of material in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901620,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we measured everything in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903900,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reason why I\nfind dust is interesting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906090,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is 'cause dust is, from an\nenvironmental point of view,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908280,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a really good way\nto tell what you and I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911040,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and our house are being exposed to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912960,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Identifying\ndangerous contaminants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914730,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a big part of what these\nstandard reference materials"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916920,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are for, which is why they have\nseveral types of lead paint"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920100,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or water from a glacier in Greenland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922290,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- These are so rare that we\nhave to limit distribution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925710,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of one unit per customer per three years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929100,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Whoa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929933,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or dirt From New Jersey and Montana."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932310,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We have a lot of soil samples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933960,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They had the permission\nto go into, essentially,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936450,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a contaminated industrial\nsite in Bozeman, Montana"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940440,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and collect a bunch of rocks,\nyou know, five gallon pail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 943110,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and bring 'em back and crunch 'em up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944820,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so these are certified, again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946560,
    "dDurationMs": 1983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for things like toxic elements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950130,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Now the ultimate way to measure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951780,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what contaminants we're exposed to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953640,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is by what comes out of us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957180,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is why NIST sells domestic sludge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960840,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a record of what\nhas come out of our bodies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963870,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and down our sewers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965580,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Researchers can examine\nit for traces of toxins"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968670,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or heavy metals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969930,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Contaminants that many\nof us may be exposed to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972210,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without knowing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973500,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really about\nenvironmental monitoring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976320,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And next year they're coming out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977640,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with an actual human poop product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980040,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's been in the news\nquite a bit as, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982830,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "health is related to\nyour microbiome, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985830,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're starting to\nunderstand that, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988710,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your gut flora and what's in your stomach"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991980,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is hugely important to your\nhealth, your mental attitude,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994620,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just all sorts of things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995820,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fecal matter is an incredibly\ndifficult matrix to measure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999270,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and extract all the\ndifferent components out of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001880,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what this material will do is support"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004550,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "measurements of the metabolites."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006620,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it'll be distributed as a\nvial of powder, essentially."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009770,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Do you know how much they got?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012470,
    "dDurationMs": 2903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- A crap load.\n(both laugh)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016670,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] As our knowledge\nof the world evolves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018590,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so too do the standard reference materials"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020570,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stored in this warehouse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022400,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "NIST is preparing to launch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023840,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its first living standard\nreference material next year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027440,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The living cells will\nbe hamster ovary cells"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030230,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can produce monoclonal antibodies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032870,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monoclonal antibodies now\naccount for five of the 10"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036080,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "top selling drugs and\nover 75 billion dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039500,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in annual sales worldwide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041570,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When monkey pox started\nspreading earlier this year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044150,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one issue with diagnosing the disease"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045950,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was that there were no\nclear laboratory tests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048110,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to tell if someone was infected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049970,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "NIST was able to create a\npositive control reference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052850,
    "dDurationMs": 2883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the monkey pox DNA in just 30 days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056600,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This warehouse is a very\nstrange place to walk around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059540,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So many disparate pieces of our world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061610,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "carefully characterized,\nlabeled, and packaged up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064910,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a reminder that behind the scenes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066920,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "invisible to most of us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068300,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are a group of\npeople working tirelessly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070670,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to ensure that things are\nwhat we think they are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074120,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we eat peanut butter\non toast, we can be sure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076730,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the peanut butter contains\nwhat the label says."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079250,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When your blood test comes back\nwith a cholesterol reading,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081830,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know it was calibrated\nwith a standard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084380,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when you walk into\na steel-framed building,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086750,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know the steel has\nthe appropriate structural"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089090,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and mechanical properties\nto hold up that structure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092060,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our world works because,\nunbeknownst to most of us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095150,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is a small army of people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097070,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "diligently checking that what is out there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099440,
    "dDurationMs": 1773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "aligns with the standards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102380,
    "dDurationMs": 2196,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even our poop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104576,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(techno music)"
    } ]
  } ]
}
